              "id": "NEET-BIO-C11-6-094",
              "question": "Evaluate these proposed associations. I. The vacuolar condition typical of young meristematic cells: Small vacuoles or no large central vacuole. II. The tissue composed mainly of one type of cell: Simple tissue. Which assessment is correct?",
