              "id": "NEET-BIO-C11-6-128",
              "question": "Evaluate these proposed associations. I. The leaf type with broadly similar upper and lower surfaces: Isobilateral leaf. II. The mesophyll differentiation common in isobilateral grass leaves: No clear palisade-spongy division. Which assessment is correct?",
